    card title "Making plans"

A: How do you ask a friend out in Russian, and agree on when?
    draw i_film i_cal

    erase i_film i_cal

B: Tom wants to take me to the cinema. Let's listen.
    draw tom tom_name masha masha_name parallel true

    draw talk

A: Свобо́дна means free: ты свобо́дна? Are you free?
    highlight talk_1_words effect underline color #c9871a part свобо́дна

    draw talk

    draw talk

B: Не могу́ and мне ну́жно рабо́тать, from lesson thirty-five: a polite no, with a reason.
    highlight talk_2_words talk_3_words effect underline color #c9871a

    erase talk

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

B: Дава́й пойдём: let's go. That's how you suggest a plan.
    highlight talk2_3_words effect underline color #c9871a part "Дава́й пойдём"

    erase talk2

    draw talk3

A: And дава́й on its own says yes: let's! Когда́ you know: when.
    highlight talk3_1_words effect underline color #c9871a part Дава́й

    draw talk3

    draw talk3

A: Now, one piece at a time.
    highlight talk3_3_words effect underline color #c9871a

    erase talk3

    hide speakers

A: First, дава́й пойдём: let's go. Learn it as one piece.
    draw a_dp a_gl

    draw a_dpte a_dpte_gl

A: Дава́й is for a friend. To вы, or to more than one person, add lesson forty-one's те: дава́йте.
    highlight a_dpte effect underline color #c9871a part те$

B: So to my mum and dad, I say: ма́ма, па́па, дава́йте пойдём в теа́тр!
    draw a_fam

    erase a_dp a_gl a_dpte a_dpte_gl a_fam

A: After дава́й пойдём comes where to: в кино́, в теа́тр, в парк. Like в парк in lesson twenty-seven, теа́тр stays as it is.
    draw p_film p_theatre p_park p_l1 p_l2 p_l3 p_stay

    erase p_film p_theatre p_park p_l1 p_l2 p_l3 p_stay

    draw d1

A: Now when. Суббо́та ends in а, so on Saturd (@highlight d1 effect underline color #3f7d4e@)ay is в суббо́ту, with the у of в шко́лу.

    draw d2

B: Пя́тница and среда́ do the same: в пя́ (@draw d5@)тницу, and в сре́ду, with the stress moved to the front.

    quiz "Now guess: on Sunday. Воскресе́нье ends in е. Which is right?" store chk reveal.text "в воскресе́нье" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 415 reveal.style label reveal.size 46 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b
        right: В воскресе́нье: no а, so nothing changes.
        wrong: Only an а turns into у. Воскресе́нье ends in е, so it stays: в воскресе́нье.
        * в воскресе́нью
        * в воскресе́нья
        + в воскресе́нье

    erase chk_stamp

    draw d4

A: Воскресе́нье stays as it is. And bef (@draw d6@)ore вто́рник, в becomes во, easier to say: во вто́рник.

B: Then the hour, from lesson twenty-six: day first, then hour. В суббо́ту в семь часо́в.
    draw d_time d_clock

    erase d1 d2 d5 d4 d6 d_time d_clock

B: Last piece: free. Tom asked me ты свобо́дна, because I'm a woman.
    draw f_gl f_tom f_masha f_f0

    erase f_f0

A: To a man, it's ты свобо́ден, with no а, like был and была́ from lesson eighteen.
    draw f_f f_m f_byl

B: And свобо́ден has an extra е before н; свобо́дна does without it.
    highlight f_m effect underline color #c9871a part ен$

    erase f_gl f_masha f_f f_tom f_m f_byl

    draw t1_pic

    quiz "Tom asks Masha: Ты … в суббо́ту? Which word fills the gap?" reveal.text "Ты свобо́дна в суббо́ту?" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 330 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 store q1 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Свобо́дна: Masha is a woman, so the а.
        wrong: Masha is a woman: свобо́дна, with the а of была́.
        + свобо́дна
        * свобо́ден
        * свобо́дно

    pause 1.2

    erase t1_pic q1_stamp

    draw t2_pic

    quiz "Suggest the theatre to a friend. Pick one." reveal.text "Дава́й пойдём в теа́тр!" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 330 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 store q2 voice b test t1
        right: В теа́тр: where to, and теа́тр stays as it is.
        wrong: You're going there, so в, and теа́тр stays as it is: в теа́тр.
        * Дава́й пойдём в теа́тре!
        + Дава́й пойдём в теа́тр!
        * Дава́й пойдём теа́тр!

    pause 1.2

    erase t2_pic q2_stamp

    draw t3_pic

    ask "Tom asks: Ты свобо́дна в ___? Make it Friday." answer ["пятницу"] default пятницу reveal.text "в пя́тницу" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 330 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 store q3 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Пя́тницу: пя́тница's а becomes у after в.
        wrong: Start from пя́тница; after в, its а becomes у: в пя́тницу.

    pause 1.2

    erase t3_pic q3_stamp

    draw t4_pic

    quiz "Masha says: дава́й пойдём в парк! You're free. What do you answer? Pick one." reveal.text "Да, дава́й!" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 330 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 store q4 voice b test t1
        right: Да, дава́й: yes, let's!
        wrong: Не могу́ and мне ну́жно рабо́тать say no. Yes is да, дава́й!
        * Не могу́.
        * Мне ну́жно рабо́тать.
        + Да, дава́й!

    pause 1.2

    erase t4_pic q4_stamp

    draw t5_pic

    quiz "Now ask Masha's mum and dad to the cinema. Pick one." reveal.text "Дава́йте пойдём в кино́!" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 330 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 store q5 voice a test t1
        right: Дава́йте: two people, so the те.
        wrong: Two people get вы, so add the те: дава́йте.
        * Дава́й пойдём в кино́!
        + Дава́йте пойдём в кино́!
        * Дай пойдём в кино́!

    pause 1.2

    erase t5_pic q5_stamp

    group plan members ["pc_k1","pc_1","pc_k2","pc_2","pc_k3","pc_3","pc_k4","pc_4"]
    parallel true

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: So a plan has four pieces: ты свобо́ден or свобо́дна, дава́й пойдём, where to, and when: the day, then the hour.
    highlight pc_1 effect underline color #c9871a

B: And the answer: да, дава́й, or не могу́.
    draw pc_yes pc_no

    erase plan pc_yes pc_no

    show speakers

    dialogue end_talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"a","text":"Ма́ша, дава́й пойдём в теа́тр в суббо́ту?","gloss":"Masha, shall we go to the theatre on Saturday?"},{"by":"b","text":"Да, дава́й!","gloss":"Yes, let's!"}] size 1.4 x 500 width 640

    draw end_talk

B: See you at the theatre! Next time: travel, by train and by plane. Пока́!
    icon e_theatre size 100 set twemoji x 500 y 320 or ["performing arts"] icon_look picture of "performing arts"

